  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the OECD Environment Policy Committee (EPOC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Denmark supports the work of the OECD to track, analyse and assess climate finance provided and mobilised for climate action in developing countries. These activities are included in the 2023-24a Environment Policy Committee (EPOC) Programme of Work and Budget (PWB) under output area
2.3.2.3.1 &quot;Climate finance provided and mobilised by developed countries for developing countries and associated analyses&quot;), and in the 2025-26 PWB1 (under Output 2.3.2.3.1. &quot;Tracking, alignment, consistency and integrity of finance for climate goals&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
